    <subfield code="a">Automechanic ads are paired with poetic short scenarios to create a nonsensical more than surreal work. "Holiday is a limited edition artist's made book that pairs badly printed auto advertisements with some thoughts that occurred to me (the artist) over the course of a single day. I found the juxtaposition between image and idea in this case to be poetic and ideally suited to a book format"--artist's statement.</subfield>
